## critical_pipeline_demo.src -- the program the synergy gate builds with `lume build --critical -g`: it links the
## certified kernel module unchanged (`use`), so the object code that runs here is the object code the translation
## validator, the stack analyser and the runtime-helper verifier are given (the `.s` the build leaves next to the ELF).
## Expected output, one value per line: 150 4500 120 9000 1 7 9 0 6
use critical_pipeline
print rate_limit(100, 900, 50)
print rate_limit(5000, 100, 500)
print rate_limit(100, 120, 50)
print actuator_cmd(9000, 10000, 50)
print ct_add32(4294967295, 2)
print ct_select32(0 - 1, 7, 9)
print ct_select32(0, 7, 9)
print ct_cmp_step(0, 5, 5)
print ct_cmp_step(0, 5, 3)
